'''Bonzo Statue''' is an {{Uncommon}} Cosmetic that spawns a statue of [[Bonzo]]. It is bought from the [[Bingo#Bingo Shop|{{Cyan|Bingo Shop}}]] for {{Bingo Points|30}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Bonzo Statue''' can be purchased from the [[Bingo#Bingo Shop|{{Cyan|Bingo Shop}}]] for {{Bingo Points|30}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Bonzo Statue''' can be placed on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} to spawn in a statue of {{MobSprite|Bonzo}}.

